om{99}{j} x^j \\pmod{101}$$\nUsing $\\binom{99}{j} \\equiv (-1)^j (j+1) \\pmod{101}$, the coefficient of $x^j$ is:\n$$c_j = 22(-1)^j (j+1) \\pmod{101}$$\n\n<answer>[[22,[0]],[57,[1]],[66,[2]],[13,[3]],[9,[4]],[70,[5]],[53,[6]],[26,[7]],[97,[8]],[83,[9]],[40,[10]],[39,[11]],[84,[12]],[96,[13]],[27,[14]],[52,[15]],[71,[16]],[8,[17]],[14,[18]],[65,[19]],[58,[20]],[21,[21]],[1,[22]],[78,[23]],[45,[24]],[34,[25]],[89,[26]],[91,[27]],[32,[28]],[47,[29]],[76,[30]],[3,[31]],[19,[32]],[60,[33]],[63,[34]],[16,[35]],[6,[36]],[73,[37]],[50,[38]],[29,[39]],[94,[40]],[86,[41]],[37,[42]],[42,[43]],[81,[44]],[99,[45]],[24,[46]],[55,[47]],[68,[48]],[11,[49]],[12,[50]],[67,[51]],[56,[52]],[23,[53]],[100,[54]],[80,[55]],[43,[56]],[36,[57]],[87,[58]],[93,[59]],[30,[60]],[49,[61]],[74,[62]],[5,[63]],[17,[64]],[62,[65]],[61,[66]],[18,[67]],[4,[68]],[75,[69]],[48,[70]],[31,[71]],[92,[72]],[88,[73]],[35,[74]],[44,[75]],[79,[76]],[0,[77]],[22,[78]],[57,[79]],[66,[80]],[13,[81]],[9,[82]],[70,[83]],[53,[84]],[26,[85]],[97,[86]],[83,[87]],[40,[88]],[39,[89]],[84,[90]],[96,[91]],[27,[92]],[52,[93]],[71,[94]],[8,[95]],[14,[96]],[65,[97]],[58,[98]],[21,[99]]]</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 33.14, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "easy", "escalation_round": 0}
